  data:  # a24c
    kind: work_item  # a24c
    title: "DQ-5: view-template-linker-v1 does not recognize .csv.erb template extension (11 missed Rails edges in chatwoot)"  # a24c
    status: todo_soft  # a24c
    priority: 4  # a24c
    parent:  # a24c
    tags:  # a24c
    - framework_dispatch_linkers  # a24c
    - analysis_quality  # a24c
    isbefore: []  # a24c
    duplicate_of: []  # a24c
    not_duplicate_of: []  # a24c
    pr_ref:  # a24c
    description: "## Origin\n\nFiled per hg-uat-v4.1.0 Round 08 §8.4 inverse-direction finding (master report §4 DQ-5).\n\n## Symptom\n\n11 chatwoot Api::V2::Accounts::ReportsController actions (`inboxes`, `labels`, `agents`, `conversation_traffic`, `teams`, etc.) have view files at the conventional path with `.csv.erb` extension and receive no `renders` edge from view-template-linker-v1. The linker recognizes `.html.erb`, `.json.jbuilder`, and plain `.erb` per the 204 emitted edges in chatwoot, but does not pick up `.csv.erb`.\n\n## Why it matters\n\n`.csv.erb` is a non-default but legitimate Rails template format used for CSV-export endpoints. Any Rails app that exports CSV will hit this gap. Trivial to fix once located.\n\n## Fix scope\n\nAdd `.csv.erb` to the recognized template-extension list in view-template-linker-v1 (likely a constant or regex in view_template.py). 1-2 LOC change. Spot-check whether other domain-specific Rails template extensions exist (`.xml.builder`, `.atom.builder`, `.text.erb`) and fold them in if they're similarly common.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Property test: a Rails controller action with a `.csv.erb` view at the conventional path emits a `renders` edge.\n- Re-run on chatwoot: the 11 Api::V2::Accounts::ReportsController CSV-export actions now emit edges.\n- 100% coverage on changed source.\n\n## References\n\n- Round 08 report §8.4: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_artifacts/hg-uat-v4.1.0/lab-notebook/round-08-followup-discriminators/report.md\n- Master report §4 DQ-5: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_artifacts/hg-uat-v4.1.0/lab-notebook/master-report.md\n- Producer: packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/view_template.py"  # a24c
    fields: {}  # a24c
